      "CTE Inlining vs Materialization: Optimization Fences & MATERIALIZED Hints (cte-materialization-optimization-fence): When the planner folds a CTE into the main query for predicate pushdown vs materializing it into a temp table once (PostgreSQL 12+ & SQLite semantics).",
